Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Add solar project work-structure & BOQ engine
 (solar_engine app)

Implements the config-driven engine from docs/SOLAR_PROJECT_ENGINE.md:

- Template layer (editable): ComponentSpecSet, WbsTemplate/Stage/WorkPackage,
  BoqTemplate/Section/TemplateItem.
- Project-instance layer: ProjectBuild, ProjectSizing, ProjectStage,
  ProjectWorkPackage, ProjectBoqItem (material/labour/total per the book's
  BOQ method), anchored 1:1 to core.ProjectMaster.
- Sizing calculator reproduces the 5 MW study book exactly (40 inverters,
  420 strings, 10,920 modules, 6.006 MWp, 2x2.5 MVA, 4 ACDB) and scales to
  any capacity.
- Two execution modes: rooftop (Open Roof) and ground_mount (On-Site EPC,
  default driven-pile foundation), each with its own seeded WBS + BOQ.
- seed_solar_templates management command seeds the default spec set and
  both templates; all seeded values stay editable.
- Lock (super admin / admin / project manager only) freezes the build and
  auto-drafts a purchase_orders.Quotation from material BOQ lines.
- Authenticated JSON APIs under /api/solar/ (build create/read, lock,
  sizing/BOQ/work-package edits, templates list). Django admin for template
  editing. 10 unit tests covering sizing, instantiation, lock/quotation and
  auth gating.

